      "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
      "revision": 1354944766,
      "text": "Agave salmiana is a species of the family Asparagaceae, native to central and southern Mexico. It is also reportedly naturalized in South Africa, Italy, Spain, especially in the Canary Islands, and southern Portugal."
    }
